---
import "@styles/iceland.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>冰岛地点、官网和评论</title>
  <meta name="description" content="冰岛行程地点目录，包含官方网页、谷歌地图评论和 Tripadvisor 评论入口。">
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">跳到正文</a>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="nav">
      <a class="brand" href="index.html">冰岛 10月24-30日</a>
      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="行程页面">
        <a href="./index.html">总览</a>
        <a href="./route-balanced.html">详细行程</a>
        <a href="./locations.html" aria-current="page">地点</a>
        <a href="./prep.html">准备</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero small" style="--hero-image: url('https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Erupting_geysir.jpg?width=960');">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="eyebrow">官网和评论入口</p>
        <h1>主路线地点目录。</h1>
        <p>每个地点都附有官方来源、谷歌地图评论和 Tripadvisor 评论入口。通行、安全和营业信息以官方页面为准。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band" id="reykjavik">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2><ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>、<ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby>和温泉</h2>
        <div class="location-grid">
          <article class="location-card" id="hallgrimskirkja">
            <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Hallgrimskirkja_mai_2026.jpg?width=800" alt="雷克雅未克的哈尔格林姆教堂">
            <div class="location-body">
              <p class="region"><ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby></p>
              <h3><ruby>哈尔格林姆教堂<rt>Hallgrímskirkja</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>抵达日最适合的城市地标；天气清楚时塔楼视野很好。</p>
              <p class="note"><strong>10月：</strong>放在抵达日，或作为坏天气城市项目。</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                <a href="https://www.hallgrimskirkja.is/en-gb/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官网</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Hallgrímskirkja+Reykjavík+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">谷歌评论</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Hallgrímskirkja%20Reykjavík" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tripadvisor 评论</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="location-card" id="harpa">
            <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Harpa_Iceland.jpg?width=800" alt="雷克雅未克哈帕音乐厅外观">
            <div class="location-body">
              <p class="region"><ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby></p>
              <h3><ruby>哈帕音乐厅<rt>Harpa</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>滨水音乐厅，玻璃外墙很有辨识度；雨天或大风天也适合。</p>
              <p class="note"><strong>10月：</strong>可和旧港晚餐搭配。</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                <a href="https://www.harpa.is/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官网</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Harpa+Reykjavík+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">谷歌评论</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Harpa%20Reykjavík" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tripadvisor 评论</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="location-card" id="perlan">
            <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Reykjavik_Perlan.jpg?width=800" alt="雷克雅未克珍珠楼">
            <div class="location-body">
              <p class="region"><ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby></p>
              <h3><ruby>珍珠楼<rt>Perlan</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>室内博物馆和观景台，可作为坏天气替代或长途驾驶后的轻松项目。</p>
              <p class="note"><strong>10月：</strong>雨大风大时很实用。</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                <a href="https://www.perlan.is/en-gb" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官网</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Perlan+Reykjavík+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">谷歌评论</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Perlan%20Reykjavík" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tripadvisor 评论</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="location-card" id="sky-lagoon">
            <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Sky_Lagoon_Exterior.jpg?width=800" alt="雷克雅未克附近的天空温泉外观">
            <div class="location-body">
              <p class="region">温泉</p>
              <h3><ruby>天空温泉<rt>Sky Lagoon</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p><ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>附近的地热温泉，比长途后绕去<ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby>更简单。</p>
              <p class="note"><strong>10月：</strong>抵达日或最后一晚都可考虑。</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                <a href="https://www.skylagoon.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官网</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Sky+Lagoon+Iceland+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">谷歌评论</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Sky%20Lagoon%20Iceland" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tripadvisor 评论</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="location-card" id="blue-lagoon">
            <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Blue_Lagoon_Iceland_hdsr_2019_10_19_9999_395.jpg?width=800" alt="蓝湖地热温泉">
            <div class="location-body">
              <p class="region"><ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby></p>
              <h3><ruby>蓝湖<rt>Blue Lagoon</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>靠近<ruby>凯夫拉维克<rt>Keflavík</rt></ruby>的经典最后一日温泉，已移到 10月29日，以避开抵达日航班延误风险。</p>
              <p class="note"><strong>10月：</strong>开车前检查官方地震和通行更新。</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                <a href="https://www.bluelagoon.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官网</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.bluelagoon.com/seismic-activity" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">状态</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Blue+Lagoon+Iceland+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">谷歌评论</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Blue%20Lagoon%20Iceland" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tripadvisor 评论</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="location-card" id="kleifarvatn">
            <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Lake_Kleifarvatn%2C_Iceland_%2841495264840%29.jpg?width=800" alt="雷克雅内斯半岛的克莱瓦湖">
            <div class="location-body">
              <p class="region"><ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby></p>
              <h3><ruby>克莱瓦湖<rt>Kleifarvatn</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p><ruby>克里苏维克<rt>Krýsuvík</rt></ruby>区域的大湖，适合作为从<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>出发的<ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby>小环线开场。</p>
              <p class="note"><strong>10月：</strong>路边和风感可能很差，短停即可。</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                <a href="https://www.visitreykjanes.is/en/place/kleifarvatn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官网</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Kleifarvatn+Iceland+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">谷歌评论</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Kleifarvatn%20Iceland" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tripadvisor 评论</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="location-card" id="seltun">
            <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Selt%C3%BAn.JPG?width=800" alt="塞尔屯地热区">
            <div class="location-body">
              <p class="region"><ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby></p>
              <h3><ruby>塞尔屯<rt>Seltún</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>色彩鲜明的<ruby>克里苏维克<rt>Krýsuvík</rt></ruby>地热木栈道，适合安全条件下的<ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby>小环线。</p>
              <p class="note"><strong>10月：</strong>留在标记步道上；蒸汽、泥地和湿滑木板都是真风险。</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                <a href="https://www.visitreykjanes.is/en/place/seltun" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官网</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Seltún+Iceland+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">谷歌评论</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Seltún%20Iceland" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tripadvisor 评论</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="location-card" id="fagradalsfjall">
            <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Iceland%27s_Fagradalsfjall_volcano_lava.jpg?width=800" alt="法格拉达尔火山熔岩">
            <div class="location-body">
              <p class="region"><ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby></p>
              <h3><ruby>法格拉达尔火山<rt>Fagradalsfjall</rt></ruby> / <ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby>火山区</h3>
              <p>只有官方开放且条件安全时才作为可选点。把它当条件项目，不要当必去项目。</p>
              <p class="note"><strong>10月：</strong>不要进入封闭道路、新鲜熔岩、气体区域或低能见度地形。</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                <a href="https://www.visitreykjanes.is/en/volcano-eruption" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官方更新</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://safetravel.is/travel-conditions/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SafeTravel</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Fagradalsfjall+Iceland+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">谷歌评论</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Fagradalsfjall%20Iceland" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tripadvisor 评论</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="location-card" id="gunnuhver">
            <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Gunnuhver_geothermal_area.jpg?width=800" alt="贡努克维尔地热蒸汽区">
            <div class="location-body">
              <p class="region"><ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby></p>
              <h3><ruby>贡努克维尔<rt>Gunnuhver</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>靠近<ruby>凯夫拉维克<rt>Keflavík</rt></ruby>的地热区，适合最后一天短停。</p>
              <p class="note"><strong>10月：</strong>留在标记木栈道上，风可能很强。</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                <a href="https://www.visitreykjanes.is/en/place/gunnuhver" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官网</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Gunnuhver+Iceland+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">谷歌评论</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Gunnuhver%20Iceland" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tripadvisor 评论</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="location-card" id="bridge-continents">
            <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Bridge_across_continents_iceland.jpg?width=800" alt="雷克雅内斯大陆桥">
            <div class="location-body">
              <p class="region"><ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby></p>
              <h3><ruby>大陆桥<rt>Bridge Between Continents</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>连接欧亚和北美板块之间裂谷的短停点，靠近机场。</p>
              <p class="note"><strong>10月：</strong>只有风和时间都舒服时，才和<ruby>贡努克维尔<rt>Gunnuhver</rt></ruby>一起安排。</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                <a href="https://www.visitreykjanes.is/en/place/bridge-between-continents" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官网</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Bridge+Between+Continents+Iceland+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">谷歌评论</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Bridge%20Between%20Continents%20Iceland" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tripadvisor 评论</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band alt" id="golden-circle">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2><ruby>黄金圈<rt>Golden Circle</rt></ruby></h2>
        <div class="location-grid">
          <article class="location-card" id="thingvellir">
            <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/%C3%9Eingvellir_from_the_information_centre.JPG?width=800" alt="辛格维利尔裂谷景观">
            <div class="location-body">
              <p class="region"><ruby>黄金圈<rt>Golden Circle</rt></ruby></p>
              <h3><ruby>辛格维利尔国家公园<rt>Þingvellir National Park</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>裂谷步道和冰岛议会历史，通常是<ruby>黄金圈<rt>Golden Circle</rt></ruby>第一站。</p>
              <p class="note"><strong>10月：</strong>至少留 90 分钟，步道结冰时更久。</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                <a href="https://www.thingvellir.is/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官网</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Þingvellir+National+Park+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">谷歌评论</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Þingvellir%20National%20Park" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tripadvisor 评论</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="location-card" id="geysir">
            <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Erupting_geysir.jpg?width=800" alt="盖锡尔地热区喷发的间歇泉">
            <div class="location-body">
              <p class="region"><ruby>黄金圈<rt>Golden Circle</rt></ruby></p>
              <h3><ruby>盖锡尔 / 斯特罗库尔<rt>Geysir / Strokkur</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>地热区，<ruby>斯特罗库尔<rt>Strokkur</rt></ruby>会定期喷发，适合安排在<ruby>辛格维利尔<rt>Þingvellir</rt></ruby>和<ruby>黄金瀑布<rt>Gullfoss</rt></ruby>之间。</p>
              <p class="note"><strong>10月：</strong>蒸汽和积水附近的木栈道可能打滑。</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                <a href="https://www.south.is/en/place/geysir-geothermal-area" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官网</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Geysir+Geothermal+Area+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">谷歌评论</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Geysir%20Geothermal%20Area" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tripadvisor 评论</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="location-card" id="gullfoss">
            <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Gullfoss_from_the_Air_%28cropped%29.jpg?width=800" alt="黄金瀑布航拍视角">
            <div class="location-body">
              <p class="region"><ruby>黄金圈<rt>Golden Circle</rt></ruby></p>
              <h3><ruby>黄金瀑布<rt>Gullfoss</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>峡谷中的强力瀑布，常有大风和低温，是<ruby>黄金圈<rt>Golden Circle</rt></ruby>代表景点。</p>
              <p class="note"><strong>10月：</strong>穿防水层，不要走封闭或结冰步道。</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                <a href="https://www.south.is/en/place/gullfoss-waterfall" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官网</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Gullfoss+Waterfall+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">谷歌评论</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Gullfoss%20Waterfall" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tripadvisor 评论</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="location-card" id="kerid">
            <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/A_girl_standing_on_top_of_Keri%C3%B0.jpg?width=800" alt="克里兹火山口湖边缘">
            <div class="location-body">
              <p class="region"><ruby>黄金圈<rt>Golden Circle</rt></ruby></p>
              <h3><ruby>克里兹火山口<rt>Kerið Crater</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>紧凑的火山口湖，靠近<ruby>塞尔福斯<rt>Selfoss</rt></ruby>，适合作为<ruby>黄金圈<rt>Golden Circle</rt></ruby>收尾。</p>
              <p class="note"><strong>10月：</strong>环湖边缘暴露且可能泥泞。</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                <a href="https://kerid.is/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官网</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Kerið+Crater+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">谷歌评论</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Kerið%20Crater" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tripadvisor 评论</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band" id="south">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>南岸和东南部</h2>
        <div class="location-grid">
          <article class="location-card" id="seljalandsfoss">
            <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Idyllic_landscape_with_a_waterfall_%28Unsplash%29.jpg?width=800" alt="塞里雅兰瀑布">
            <div class="location-body">
              <p class="region">南岸</p>
              <h3><ruby>塞里雅兰瀑布<rt>Seljalandsfoss</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>从环岛路可见的高瀑布，以瀑布后方步道闻名。</p>
              <p class="note"><strong>10月：</strong>步道结冰或关闭时不要走瀑布后方。</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                <a href="https://www.south.is/en/place/seljalandsfoss-waterfall" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官网</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Seljalandsfoss+reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">谷歌评论</a>
                <a class="secondary" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Seljalandsfoss" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tripadvisor 评论</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="location-card" id="skogafoss">
            <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/2008-05-24_35_Sk%C3%B3gafoss.jpg?width=800" alt="斯科加瀑布">
            <div class="location-body">
              <p class="region">南岸</p>
              <h3><ruby>斯科加瀑布<rt>Skógafoss</rt></ruby></h3>
